1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:01,876
Damn it.

2
00:00:03,294 --> 00:00:04,879
"However I wanted to"?

3
00:00:07,590 --> 00:00:08,675
Yo, Dong-uk.

4
00:00:08,675 --> 00:00:09,675
What's up?

5
00:00:11,177 --> 00:00:12,493
Just practicing.

6
00:00:12,494 --> 00:00:13,846
I'm head out now.

7
00:00:13,847 --> 00:00:15,765
Oh, with the freshman?

8
00:00:15,765 --> 00:00:17,058
Man, that kid's impressive.

9
00:00:18,977 --> 00:00:20,020
Why are you here?

10
00:00:20,895 --> 00:00:22,856
Oh, are you anxious about him?

11
00:00:23,148 --> 00:00:25,191
Quit it and just leave.

12
00:00:25,191 --> 00:00:26,609
Yeah, I bet you are.

13
00:00:26,609 --> 00:00:27,562
I felt anxious

14
00:00:27,563 --> 00:00:28,563
watching him play, too.

15
00:00:29,320 --> 00:00:31,448
I just ran into him outside.

16
00:00:32,323 --> 00:00:34,284
He's even good-looking.

17
00:00:34,743 --> 00:00:36,152
And hey, he was with

18
00:00:36,153 --> 00:00:37,440
Professor Tae-seong.

19
00:00:38,955 --> 00:00:40,999
They seemed pretty close.

20
00:00:40,999 --> 00:00:42,313
Didn't he use to give you

21
00:00:42,314 --> 00:00:43,720
all his attention?

22
00:00:44,961 --> 00:00:45,961
Hey.

23
00:00:46,254 --> 00:00:47,254
Huh?

24
00:00:48,715 --> 00:00:50,425
I'm going to practice
some more

25
00:00:50,925 --> 00:00:51,925
so you should leave.

26
00:00:52,343 --> 00:00:54,220
Alright.

27
00:00:56,139 --> 00:00:57,432
Good luck.
